Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387585052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a183e04ef121f089055073c03f16a60c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Very helpful.&amp;nbsp; We didnt&#039; actually budget for this - I love how there are so many extras popping up.&amp;nbsp; haha&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1888293,"PostDate":1425484593,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Very helpful.\u00a0 We didnt' actually budget for this - I love how there are so many extras popping up.\u00a0 haha<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>Married on June 20th, 2015 at the Grand Sunset Princess Riviera Gazebo & Reception at the Chill Out with 60 guests<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<p>My planning thread:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78801-veryvaleros-wedding-planning-thread-grand-sunset-princess\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>My review thread: \u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79344-grand-sunset-princess-platinum-yucatan-princess-wedding\/<\/a>","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396982852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1439827749","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":132,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3088ea80e08157121c3c3e9700f7d91","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1888290\" timestamp=\"1425483752\"]\nSo...what about the resort provided Wedding Coordinator who doesn&#039;t charge a fee?  What is an appropriate amount to tip?[\/quote]I had no idea. I gave ours $700 peso.  Someone told me they did something similar so I just did that. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1888446,"PostDate":1425564688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 04 March 2015 - 07:42 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>So...what about the resort provided Wedding Coordinator who doesn't charge a fee?  What is an appropriate amount to tip?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI had no idea. I gave ours $700 peso.  Someone told me they did something similar so I just did that. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"216.200.128.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c0804e16e73700783ed15c1dea174ed8","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1888446\" timestamp=\"1425564688\"]\nI had no idea. I gave ours $700 peso. Someone told me they did something similar so I just did that.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nI was thinking $50-100 USD, so that falls pretty much in line.  She&#039;s doing a great job so far, so I guess it&#039;ll depend on crunch time lol!  When did you tip her?  Before or after the wedding?","Attachments":[],"Id":1888453,"PostDate":1425567381,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 05 March 2015 - 06:11 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I had no idea. I gave ours $700 peso. Someone told me they did something similar so I just did that.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I was thinking $50-100 USD, so that falls pretty much in line. \u00a0She's doing a great job so far, so I guess it'll depend on crunch time lol! \u00a0When did you tip her? \u00a0Before or after the wedding?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>30 guests, Bride & Groom & 2 kids - one FANTASTIC time!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Planning Thread<\/strong> - Includes lots of DIY (picture-heavy)<br><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,255);\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Underwater Trash The Dress Session Photos<\/strong> - Samuel Luna (Photographer)<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7'>https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.784031153664.1073741863.54300091&type=1&l=a8a5688cd7<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Resort Review<\/strong> - <em>Crown Paradise Club Cancun<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77321-marinah84s-planning-thread-31415-crown-paradise-club-cancun\/page-28#entry1894872<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Photographer Review <\/strong>- <em>Samuel Luna<\/em> - Coming Soon!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>Makeup\/Hair Artist Review\u00a0<\/strong>-\u00a0<em>Sara Tamargo<\/em><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4968-sara-tamargo-makeup-artistry\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong>For Sale Items<\/strong> -\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79146-wedding-items-for-sale\/#entry1895327<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"marinarhianne@gmail.com","IpAddress":"67.149.51.114","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1387585052,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-275696.jpg?_r=1429206783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"marinah84","Id":275696,"Name":"marinah84","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eb0b8b8724c3b673554db102afddff3","RawContent":"[quote name=\"marinah84\" post=\"1888453\" timestamp=\"1425567381\"]\nI was thinking $50-100 USD, so that falls pretty much in line.  She&#039;s doing a great job so far, so I guess it&#039;ll depend on crunch time lol!  When did you tip her?  Before or after the wedding?[\/quote]I forgot my tips. I had meant to ask her if tipping wait staff as a group was ok then since I forgot that I just forgot them all hahah so at the dinner I asked her and told her I would see her in the am with everything. So I tipped her the next morning. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1888455,"PostDate":1425568001,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>marinah84, on 05 March 2015 - 06:56 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I was thinking $50-100 USD, so that falls pretty much in line.  She's doing a great job so far, so I guess it'll depend on crunch time lol!  When did you tip her?  Before or after the wedding?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI forgot my tips. I had meant to ask her if tipping wait staff as a group was ok then since I forgot that I just forgot them all hahah so at the dinner I asked her and told her I would see her in the am with everything. So I tipped her the next morning. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"73.187.200.64","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b0682cc7b997f349b2c20afd16aeca38","RawContent":"thanks! very helpful","Attachments":[],"Id":1892510,"PostDate":1428607934,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                thanks! very helpful\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaspbri0317@aol.com","IpAddress":"71.58.144.195","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1296688027,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236302.jpg?_r=1429022808","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jaspbri0317","Id":236302,"Name":"jaspbri0317","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.51.123.197","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"73fbeed559d8208d902067014af7754e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I am happy I came across this post again.. I was starting to wonder this all over again, esp as our date is quickly approaching!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892565,"PostDate":1428634134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I am happy I came across this post again.. I was starting to wonder this all over again, esp as our date is quickly approaching!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><span style=\"color:#ff6666;\">I love him & he loves me, we'll be married by the sea.<\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/77696-our-dw-dreams-riviera-cancun-17-apr-2015\/'>Planning\u00a0Journal<\/a>\u00a0& <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/blog\/86-my-destination-wedding-blog\/'>Blog<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/beach-wedding-dreams-riviera-cancun-tj\/'>My wedding pictures from Del Sol Photography<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"tricia.d.davis@gmail.com","IpAddress":"97.91.185.236","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1396280519,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277418.jpg?_r=1429976005","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"pddcmc","Id":277418,"Name":"pddcmc","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"159.53.78.142","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df6f15211c68f15fa94ee935c78d7425","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Funny - I was just showing my fiance my budget spreadsheet and the line item for tips made his eyes bulge!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;He just thinks the vendor prices are already really high, which they are. They aren&#039;t any cheaper than Chicago vendors for the most part! We can determine when we get there who has gone above-and-beyond and deserves a little more, but I told him we need to at least be prepared and have a plan! And I don&#039;t want to be dealing with it on our wedding night. That is the LAST thing I want to be thinking about.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1892651,"PostDate":1428678414,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Funny - I was just showing my fiance my budget spreadsheet and the line item for tips made his eyes bulge!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>He just thinks the vendor prices are already really high, which they are. They aren't any cheaper than Chicago vendors for the most part! We can determine when we get there who has gone above-and-beyond and deserves a little more, but I told him we need to at least be prepared and have a plan! And I don't want to be dealing with it on our wedding night. That is the LAST thing I want to be thinking about.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.shaffer@gmail.com","IpAddress":"159.53.174.144","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1403116087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"beckys98","Id":278581,"Name":"beckys98","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"174.90.223.128","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76758,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b692a4209b4d07422d38de45d119de9","RawContent":"[quote name=\"beckys98\" post=\"1892651\" timestamp=\"1428678414\"]\nFunny - I was just showing my fiance my budget spreadsheet and the line item for tips made his eyes bulge!\n\nHe just thinks the vendor prices are already really high, which they are. They aren&#039;t any cheaper than Chicago vendors for the most part! We can determine when we get there who has gone above-and-beyond and deserves a little more, but I told him we need to at least be prepared and have a plan! And I don&#039;t want to be dealing with it on our wedding night. That is the LAST thing I want to be thinking about.[\/quote]Good point. Does the resort just pocket those vendor fees? That&#039;s a lot they make!\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892678,"PostDate":1428692539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>beckys98, on 10 April 2015 - 07:06 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Funny - I was just showing my fiance my budget spreadsheet and the line item for tips made his eyes bulge!<br><br>\nHe just thinks the vendor prices are already really high, which they are. They aren't any cheaper than Chicago vendors for the most part! We can determine when we get there who has gone above-and-beyond and deserves a little more, but I told him we need to at least be prepared and have a plan! And I don't want to be dealing with it on our wedding night. That is the LAST thing I want to be thinking about.<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nGood point. Does the resort just pocket those vendor fees? That's a lot they make!<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399428602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":22,"TotalPages":3,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":20},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
